<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;font-weight:400;color:<%= MailerTheme::HEADING_TEXT %>;line-height:1.2;">
  Confirm your email change
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;color:<%= MailerTheme::BODY_TEXT %>;">
  Someone requested to change the email address on this account from
  <strong style="color:<%= MailerTheme::HEADING_TEXT %>;"><%= @user.email %></strong>
  to <strong style="color:<%= MailerTheme::HEADING_TEXT %>;"><%= @user.unconfirmed_email %></strong>.
</p>

<div style="margin-bottom:24px;">
  <%= render "shared/mailer/code_card", code: @code, label: "Confirmation code", expires_in_minutes: @expires_in_minutes %>
</div>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:<%= MailerTheme::BODY_TEXT %>;">
  Enter this code to approve the change.
  <strong style="color:<%= MailerTheme::HEADING_TEXT %>;">Both</strong> the old and new email addresses must confirm before the change takes effect.
</p>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:<%= MailerTheme::BODY_TEXT %>;">
  If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
